I can help by . I can respect “no.” When a problem is too big, I can tell .$s40c_jp$,
  intention_prompt       = $s40c_ip$Try one kid-sized act of help this week.$s40c_ip$,
  core_affirmation       = $s40c_ca$I can be kind without fixing everything. I ask, I listen, I help with kid-sized things, and I get a trusted grown-up for big problems.$s40c_ca$,
  weekly_practice_mon    = $s40c_pm$Ask before helping once.$s40c_pm$,
